{/eq}. We use integration by parts, selecting:

$$\begin{align}

u &= \ln(2x) \, , v' = 1\\

u' &= \frac{1}{x} \, , v = x

\end{align}

$$

 Applying integration by parts, we obtain:

$$\begin{align}

\int_2^5\ln(2x) \, dx &= \left( \ln(2x) (x) \right) |_{2}^{5} - \int_2^5 \frac{x}{x} \, dx     & \bigg\{ \begin{array}{ll}

